# 📊 Power BI Sales Dashboard

## 📌 Project Overview

This project is an interactive Power BI dashboard created to analyze sales performance and generate meaningful business insights.

## 🛠️ Tools Used

- Power BI
- Power Query
- DAX
- Excel

## 📊 Dashboard

![Power BI Dashboard](images/dashboard.png)

## 🔍 Key Analysis

- Overall sales performance
- Region-wise sales analysis
- Monthly sales trends
- Product/category performance
- KPI analysis
- Interactive filtering using slicers

## 📁 Project Files

- `dashboard/Sales_Dashboard.pbix` - Power BI dashboard file
- `images/dashboard.png` - Dashboard screenshot

## 💡 Key Insights

The dashboard helps identify sales trends, high-performing regions, and areas that require business attention.

